Keep settings functional where possible.

10. Screen 8 — Appearance

Options:

Appearance

○ System
○ Light
○ Dark

Changing the setting should immediately update the interface.

11. Screen 9 — Notifications

Allow users to toggle:

Daily Reminder       ON/OFF

Reminder Time        8:00 PM

For V1, if actual notifications aren't implemented, the UI should still be structured so notification functionality can be added later.

12. Empty States

The app must not look broken when there are no habits.

First-time Home

Show:

No habits yet

Start building your routine
by creating your first habit.

        + Create Habit

After creating the first habit, the normal dashboard appears.

